# codecs/json: to-json-pretty handles empty dict and array compactly
[include %libdir "codecs/json.llt"]

---

[empty-dict: [to-json-pretty []]]
[empty-array: [to-json-pretty []]]
[nested: [to-json-pretty [x: [] y: []]]]

[empty-dict: empty-dict  empty-array: empty-array  nested: nested]
